## The setup prompt (CC0 1.0, public domain)

The copy-paste agent instructions this repo ships for setup (the setup prompt,
also mirrored on buildwithamemory.com) are released under CC0 1.0. They are
meant to be copied. Paste them, change them, ship them in your own tool, no
attribution and no permission needed.

Full text: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

